It builds on the ideas of DeepSeek Harness (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)
and DS Bot App (https://github.com/QingJ01/DS-Bot-App, Apache-2.0). No source code
from those projects is copied into this repository; the wire protocol described in
docs/PROTOCOL.md was re-derived from observed behaviour of a locally installed DSH.

Third-party runtime dependencies are used through their package managers and keep
their own licenses:
  - AndroidX / Jetpack Compose (Apache-2.0)
  - Kotlin, kotlinx.coroutines, kotlinx.serialization (Apache-2.0)
  - OkHttp (Apache-2.0)
  - Node.js built-in modules only for host/dsbot-bridge.mjs (no bundled packages)
